<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Petroz year net profit rises 16 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Petroz year net profit rises 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  9.89 vs 6.05</p>
<p>    Net profit			  5.32 vs 4.57</p>
<p>    Sales				36.40 vs 35.21</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Petroz NL is an oil and gas producer with operations in the Timor Sea between Australia and Indonesia, and Queensland's onshore Surat Basin.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
